# PsySense environment variables.
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
#
# Non-secret tunables (ports, URLs, timeouts, DB path) live in
# psysense/config/config.yaml instead -- only actual secrets belong here.
# If you have an older .env with SUPABASE_URL/SUPABASE_KEY/API_HOST/
# API_PORT/SQLITE_DB/SYNC_INTERVAL/FRONTEND_URL from an earlier attempt at
# this project: Supabase was dropped in favor of a self-hosted bridge_api
# (see README "Deployment topology"), and the rest of those moved into
# config.yaml. They can be deleted.

# --- bridge_api admin auth (required) ---
# Generate with: python -m scripts.create_admin  (run from psysense/)
ADMIN_USERNAME=
ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=
JWT_SECRET=

# --- Optional: LLM integration (uncomment when actually used; see
# CLAUDE.md Sec 38 -- do not wire this in without an explicit feature
# that needs it) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
